  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Donovan Mitchell's legacy continues on the streets and on-court in the adidas D.O.N. Issue 6. Channelling his fearless style and flashy moves on the court, these silhouettes feature Lightstrike Pro cushioning to help you move like 'Spida' with plush comfort and unmatched responsiveness. The now-iconic Spida logo echoes Donovan's electric moves on the court and adds unapologetic flair to your hoops-inspired look. Fly at full speed and attack the rim in style with the adidas D.O.N. Issue 6.</p> <p><strong>adidas D.O.N. Issue 6 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Regular fit offers a relaxed feel.</li> <li>Mesh upper keeps things breathable.</li> <li>Lace closure ensures a secure fit.</li> <li>TPU midfoot plate adds stability.</li> <li>Uniquely designed outsole maximises traction.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Attack the lane, change direction fast, and stay comfortable through all four quarters in the adidas D.O.N. Issue 6. Built for Donovan Mitchell's explosive style of play, this basketball shoe pairs plush Lightstrike Pro cushioning with breathable support, so you can play with speed, confidence, and control.</p><ul><li>Regular fit</li><li>Breathable mesh upper</li><li>Lace closure for a secure feel</li><li>TPU midfoot plate for added stability</li><li>Uniquely designed outsole built to maximize traction</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, most players should start with their usual men's size. Reviews point to a comfortable, slightly roomy shape that feels accommodating through the forefoot, especially for wider feet, while players who prefer a more locked-in feel may prefer the closer of two sizes.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Ideal for players across positions who want cushioned comfort, quick movement, and dependable traction.</p>  <p><strong>Court Feel &amp; Traction</strong></p><p>The outsole is built to maximize grip, and reviewers highlight strong traction with minimal dust pickup for confident cuts and stops. Underfoot, Lightstrike Pro cushioning helps keep the ride responsive, while the TPU midfoot plate adds stability through hard changes of direction.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas D.O.N. Issue 6 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Orange Tint/Acid Orange/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>JI1549</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">adidas Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official adidas shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\